A root README covering the control daemon, the profile-based configuration, the
keybox, and the Gradle build, plus a README for each subproject — the injector,
the two interceptors, and the Rust TA — explaining how each works. The KeyMint
interceptor README documents the current attest-key handling: keys with ATTEST_KEY
purpose minted in the TA, the remote-provisioning denial for target apps, the
foreign-key forward and startup purge, and caller-uid routing.
